    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descension tells the story of Ruby, a young man wanting to right a past wrong and save his childhood friend. Ruby and his 3 best friends must traverse the Alternate Realm, a land haunted and ruled by The Ultimate Entity. Forget what you know about class-based RPGs - there are no White Mages or Warriors in this game, so bring your creativity and a willingness to learn a new way to play. All 17+ classes are completely unique to Descension and have never been seen before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox gameplay (everything is available from the start of the game)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ boss rush style battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17+ different classes, called Soul Shards, all unique to Descension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 different stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist story, but still impactful</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to swap characters mid-battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill Gem system that encourages saving up Gems for powerful attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 party members, with complete control over customization of each character</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descension tells the story of Ruby, a young man wanting to right a past wrong and save his childhood friend. Ruby and his 3 best friends must traverse the Alternate Realm, a land haunted and ruled by The Ultimate Entity. Forget what you know about class-based RPGs - there are no White Mages or Warriors in this game, so bring your creativity and a willingness to learn a new way to play. All 17+ classes are completely unique to Descension and have never been seen before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox gameplay (everything is available from the start of the game)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ boss rush style battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17+ different classes, called Soul Shards, all unique to Descension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 different stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist story, but still impactful</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to swap characters mid-battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill Gem system that encourages saving up Gems for powerful attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 party members, with complete control over customization of each character</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Resolve a deep seated guilt by traversing the Alternate Realm and defeating The Ultimate Entity! This sandbox RPG has everything available from the start of the game, allowing your creativity to go wild. Fight in ever evolving boss battles, and equip Crystals to boost your 12 stats.",
